[{"id":"1265302880950595586","date":1590506689000,"rawContent":"Another Minneapolis Police Officer murdering another black man.\n\n@HennepinAtty, you MUST bring murder charges.\n@MinneapolisPD, this officer MUST be fired NOW.\n@Jacob_Frey, you MUST follow through, and assure the MPD cleans house of these racist creeps.\n\n#BlackLivesMatter damnit.","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":25,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1265501504678567943","date":1590554045000,"rawContent":"@MayorFrey - You have a problem. First, your officers murder George Floyd. Now, they have attacked protesters. \n\nMinneapolis is still in America, right? \n\nWould you have let them march if they were all white and had assault rifles?\n\n#FreedomOfSpeech\n#BlackLivesMatter - damnit.","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":26,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":2.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1265837579376766978","date":1590634171000,"rawContent":"Read Tarana's thread and, for a split second, imagine that anyone of these black men were a human you knew or cared about. Now, imagine them having to live by special \"rules,\" and in fear of \"breaking\" one they may not even know exists.\n\nIs that freedom?\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":27,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":3.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266587985392386049","date":1590813082000,"rawContent":"Reports from all over the country - Denver, Atlanta, Des Moines, New York - a whole lot of \"protesters\" who are NOT. Instead, they are trying to make #BlackLivesMatter\/allies look bad by starting violence.\n\nWe cannot let people with their own agenda derail change and peace.","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":28,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266773622657605633","date":1590857341000,"rawContent":"Proof of what I have been told from almost every protest around the country - there is an organized effort to try to discredit #BlackLivesMatter by bringing in outsiders to cause chaos and violence. \n\nThe real protesters want peace, change, and justice for George Floyd.","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":29,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266775276450701313","date":1590857736000,"rawContent":"All of this. Every time someone questions how Black people could feel oppressed, angry, let down by our country, these are just some of the things I remind them of. \n\nAmerica has been failing Black people since the first enslaved human stepped on this land. #BlackLivesMatter","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":30,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266807982110781442","date":1590865533000,"rawContent":"Thread on today's peaceful march for #BlackLivesMatter in Des Moines.","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":31,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266931220287545345","date":1590894916000,"rawContent":"That red-head Todd Magel just interviewed on KCCI is *that* protester, the one who has to talk in his white savior language to let people know he is there. \ud83d\ude44\n\nCongratulations on your moment red, now move along.\n\n#BlackLivesMatter \n#DesMoines","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":32,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1267161800065331200","date":1590949890000,"rawContent":"This is happening all over. These people are trying to make Black people look bad! It is their plan. \n\nThey are making this more dangerous - giving bad cops, and Trump, excuses. Damnit.\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":1