 (like my mom).  #Peace #RacialJustice #BlackLivesMatter \n\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/qaMOLxveln","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":27.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":51,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":27.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1271536190869647366","date":1591992826000,"rawContent":"I am so proud of the #BlackLivesMatter leaders here in #Iowa, and members of the #IALegis, who led this amazing effort over the last two weeks. And, I am proud of the bipartisan support this bill received. It's a step in the right direction. \n\nNow, BLM leaders - Run for office!","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":28.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":52,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":28.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1271551588562337795","date":1591996497000,"rawContent":"#CHAZ #art for #BlackLivesMatter. \n\n#peace","userId":15076380,"media":null,"username":"writeriowa","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":29.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":53,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":67,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":29.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1271554286741266433","date":1591997140000,"rawContent":"A great story and lesson about community safety from a small turn of the last century town in southern #Iowa. \n\nA town that fully understood, #BlackLivesMatter.","userId":15076380,"media":n